OL,3,GNEWSAArmed police called to school
OL,4,Aafter threat report
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmed police officers were sent to a
OL,7,Fschool after reports of a threat
OL,8,Finvolving a knife.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to St Paul's
OL,11,FCatholic School, Phoenix Drive, Milton
OL,12,FKeynes, at about 11:00 BST, which went
OL,13,Finto a temporary lockdown.
OL,15,F"Because a knife was mentioned, armed
OL,16,Fresponse units attended and conducted a
OL,17,Fthorough search, including of two
OL,18,Findividuals, and nothing was found,"
OL,19,Fsaid a Thames Valley Police
OL,20,Fspokesperson.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
