OL,3,GNEWSAArmed police called to school
OL,4,Aafter threat report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe armed officers were stood down by
OL,7,F11:50 and neighbourhood police
OL,8,Fconducted reassurance patrols until
OL,9,Fabout 16:20, the spokesperson added.
